<title>USA: Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the weekly U.S. grain and soybean export inspections due from the USDA today at 1000 CST are as follows, in millions of bushels.</p>
<p>		     Range	    week ago</p>
<p> Soybeans     20.0 to 23.0	35.305</p>
<p> All wheat    16.0 to 18.0	14.334</p>
<p> Corn	   28.0 to 31.0	42.012</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
